  "system": {
    "identifier": "namikaze-swift-release-accelerate-decelerate",
    "description": "<p>You focus your Chakra, accelerating or decelerating the impact of an attack or jutsu, lessening or multiplying its force.</p>\n<p>Accelerate. The target takes 2d10 extra Wind or Lightning damage from the triggering instance of damage.</p>\n<p>Decelerate. Reduce the damage dealt by the triggering instance of damage by 2d10.</p>\n<p>Interdiction Seal. A creature marked with this seal that takes additional damage or has their damage reduced, must make a Charisma saving throw. On a failed save, the seal triggers, with chains shooting from it, connecting to the ground until the end of their next turn. For the duration, a creature that failed their saving throw cannot move more than 5 feet from their current space and take a -1 penalty to dexterity saving throws.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage dealt or reduced by 1d10.</p>",
